  Fix: Run prefaix setup, then restart the shell.
"
`;

exports[`reports an unreadable config file 1`] = `
"✗ Configuration could not be read.
  Fix: Check config.toml access permissions and file type.
"
`;

exports[`reports an unresolved runtime layout 1`] = `
"✗ The runtime layout cannot be resolved.
  Fix: Use absolute HOME and XDG directory paths, then rerun prefaix doctor.
"
`;

exports[`reports an unsafe socket 1`] = `
"✗ Daemon socket has unsafe ownership, type, or permissions.
  Fix: Stop the daemon; restore your ownership and mode 0600 on its socket. Do not use a symlink.
"
`;

exports[`reports an unusable installation 1`] = `
"✗ pi RPC probe was skipped because the installation is not usable.
  Fix: Repair or upgrade pi, then rerun prefaix doctor.
"
`;

exports[`reports bash 3.2 degraded support 1`] = `
