"
`;

exports[`reports every healthy check and never prompts the backend 1`] = `
"✓ Configuration and PREFAIX overrides are valid.
✓ pi is installed.
✓ pi meets the tested minimum (0.87.1).
✓ pi RPC handshake, state, models, commands, idle abort, and shutdown passed without a model request.
✓ zsh meets the supported version requirement.
✓ The prefaix shell plugin is loaded.
✓ No Forge plugin conflict detected.
✓ No ble.sh conflict detected.
✓ Runtime directory is absent; the daemon will create it securely when needed.
✓ Daemon socket is absent; the daemon will create it securely when needed.
✓ A clipboard tool is available.
"
`;

